{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i>Summer vacation is coming, and due to your mother's work, you and her come to a remote town together to establish a communication base station.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The name of the town is The Hot Spring Town, but due to its remote location and lack of internet access, there are not many people in the town anymore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this simple town, you will meet all kinds of people and experience different stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to obtain funds through activities such as insect catching, fishing, flower picking, bird watching, while enjoying rural life. Use the funds to purchase small town stalls, attract customers, rebuild convenience stores and other shops, and hire staff; After the establishment of the internet, using social media to take beautiful pictures to attract migrant workers; Maintain town roads, road management, etc Start the plan to revitalize the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/E1.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use WASD to move and space to jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/E2.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Regarding the camera: This game is essentially a 3D game, but playing from a horizontal perspective can provide the best experience* Some specific activities, such as cooking, will be conducted from a first person perspective.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make good use of tools to fish, catch insects, and farm freely in the small town, and earn income to buy fun things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/E3.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/E4.png?t=1751298325\" /></div>The loot obtained is divided into white, green, blue, and gold levels, with higher value for rarer items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/4.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check your catalog, there are captured collectibles inside!\uff08waiting for translation....\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/5.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone loves fishing and farming.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/E5.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can entrust the mayor to take you on a car tour of the town (similar to a fast trip) and have the player control the car themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/E7.png?t=1751298325\" /></div>if you have internet, you can upload a beauty map to social media, get a comment and attention to the good news, make more exotic population travel to the town, and it is likely to get more town income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/E8.png?t=1751298325\" /></div>A sea view room of your own! Love comes from the residents of Hot Spring Town!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/E9.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you feel tired, you can also spend time at home and improve your character's attributes by resting and relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy a cup of green tea every day to enhance your character's insight points! Insight points can be used to observe potential development opportunities in small towns and establish new buildings!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/E11.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can donate your money to establish and develop the town, and the town's income will also be returned to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/E10.png?t=1751298325\" /></div>Managing your residence and placing treasures can enhance various outputs of the town, and even change some gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/E12.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the game, need to pay attention to your physical strength and thirst level, which can be supplemented by consuming food and drinks. Otherwise, you can only go home early to rest!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/\u65e59.png?t=1751298325\" /></div>Vending machine, waiting for translation....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/E13.png?t=1751298325\" /></div>Go meet new friends! Solve their problems, and become good friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/15.png?t=1751298325\" /></div>Fishing with friends.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/19.png?t=1751298325\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/20.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Helping at Tanaka's sushi restaurant *(this part is from a first person perspective)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/16.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/17.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/18.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your small supermarket well...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/21.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attend a grand gathering with friends\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is under continuous development....</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573190?t=1751298325","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573190?t=1751298325","capsule_image":"https://shared.a