me early to rest!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/\u65e59.png?t=1751298325\" /></div>Vending machine, waiting for translation....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/E13.png?t=1751298325\" /></div>Go meet new friends! Solve their problems, and become good friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/15.png?t=1751298325\" /></div>Fishing with friends.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/19.png?t=1751298325\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/20.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Helping at Tanaka's sushi restaurant *(this part is from a first person perspective)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/16.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/17.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/18.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your small supermarket well...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/21.png?t=1751298325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attend a grand gathering with friends\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is under continuous development....</p>","developers":["\u997c\u997c Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/72f47c44b4005f36c3e4896a32a41b37fc83954f/header.jpg?t=1751298325","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125558,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125558/movie480.mp4?t=1749972077","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125558/movie_max.mp4?t=1749972077"},"name":"\u590d\u5174\u5427\u6e29\u6cc9\u9547\u65b0\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247\u82f1\u8bed","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125558/4dd19c450a8e00db6a9fb86cc6e22712f20bcd61/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749972077","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125558/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749972077","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125558/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749972077"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257156882,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156882/movie480.mp4?t=1749925689","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156882/movie_max.mp4?t=1749925689"},"name":"No.2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156882/051ddd1aeb9b38d024c6052448e1af04bd59082d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749925689","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156882/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749925689","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156882/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749925689"}}],"name":"Revive The Town!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum"